===Noun===
{{en-noun|+|conjunctivae}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} A clear [[mucous membrane]] that lines the inner surface of the [[eyelid]] and the [[exposed]] surface of the [[eyeball]] or [[sclera]].
#: {{hypo|en|bulbar conjunctiva}}

